  "instructions": [
    "Bring a large pot of water to a boil and cook the udon noodles according to package instructions.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together yuzu juice, soy sauce, sesame oil, grated ginger, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Drain the cooked noodles and toss with the yuzu sauce mixture until well coated.",
    "Stir in dried seaweed, green onions, and toasted sesame seeds.",
    "Knead the noodle mixture until it forms a cohesive dough.",
    "Divide the dough into small pieces and shape into songpyeon forms.",
    "Steam the songpyeon shapes for 10 minutes or until cooked through.",
    "Serve warm and enjoy."
